extends include/layout
block header 
    +header('services')

block content
    .main-content-wrapper
        .main-content__header
            h2.main-content-title 
                | Real Estate Software & App
            ul.breadcrumb
                li
                    a(href="index.html") home
                    span.breadcrumb-Separator /
                li
                    a(href="our-services.html")  Our Services
                    span.breadcrumb-Separator /
                li
                    span.active Real Estate Software & App

                
        .main-content__body
            .services-inner-page 
                .content-list-wrapper 
                    .icon-wrapper 
                        img(src="/assets/images/real-estate.svg")
                    .content-item
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | “CTRLM Real estate management System” is an advanced web-based software package that automates all business processes for the real estate industry.
                            | It provides a fully-integrated cycle for operations, finance and facility management and hence solves
                            | the problem of lack of coordination among departments. In addition a built-in customer relationship management (CRM) system, 
                            |a document management system and smart marketing tools that make it categorically THE software to efficiently support a real estate organization of any size. not only delivers savings in both time and money, but also has the capability to reduce human error.
                    .content-item
                        h4.content-item__title 
                            |Main Modules::
                        span.content-item__sub-title A. People
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | To manage (Staff, Landlord, Customer, Vendors, Contacts .. etc.)
                        span.content-item__sub-title B. Asset Management
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | keeps track of all fixed assets, listing while also having the capability to manage asset depreciation
                            | calculations: Property creation, Component creation, Model creation, Unit for Lease creation, Unit for Sale creation, Parking Unit creation, Mass Unit Generation, Mass Unit Update, Asset Equipment,
                            | Asset Depreciation, Visualization Designer, Visualization Availability, Unit Albums .. etc.)
                        span.content-item__sub-title C. Leasing
                        p.content-item__desc
                            | Allows for dynamic contract and agreements generation to ease the process flow for leasing,
                            | budgeting and legal management. (Management Agreement, Lease Potential, Offers, Quotations, Reservations, Leasing Agreement, Utility Agreement, Facility Agreement, Renewals, Checkout,
                            | Mega Lease, CAM, Notices, Legal, Custom Agreement, Custom Receipt & others)
                .content-photo
                    img(src="/assets/images/servicesDetails.png")
